    "Your Mac didn’t confirm it. It may have arrived: try again and it won’t be done twice.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tu Mac no lo confirmó. Puede que llegara: vuelve a intentarlo y no se hará dos veces."}}}},
    "Your Mac’s data was reset, so this answer no longer applies.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Los datos de tu Mac se reiniciaron, así que esta respuesta ya no aplica."}}}},
