    "Turn on Local Network for Alondra in System Settings › Privacy & Security. It reconnects as soon as you do.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Activa Red local para Alondra en Ajustes del Sistema › Privacidad y seguridad. Se reconectará en cuanto lo hagas."}}}},
